[[File:Kindling (Chambers of Xeric) detail.png|left|150px]]
'''Kindlings''' are obtained from chopping [[Sapling (Chambers of Xeric)|saplings]] found within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. They can be lit with a [[tinderbox]] to make [[fire]]s and used as fuel for the [[brazier (Chambers of Xeric)|braziers]] in the [[ice demon]]'s lair.

Kindling works on a timer system, which is affected by the icefiends which spawn inside of the room, as well as a weighting system. Each kindling gives 36 points, while lighting the brazier gives 32 points.

The yield per successful chop from a sapling is scaled to the player's [[Woodcutting]] level, up to a maximum of eight. The experience gained also varies, scaling based on the amount of kindling received. Kindling is stackable, but having 28 or more in your inventory will prevent you from chopping more [[Sapling (Chambers of Xeric)|saplings]]. This can be circumvented by dropping kindling to chop more and picking up the dropped kindling.

